            "review_title": "Review at Square Cafe",
            "review_text": "MM R\nHavelock North, New Zealand45 contributions\n0\nA delight to Dine\nAug 2011\nA fabulous restaurant with delightful flavoured food both western and vietnamese. The fresh juices were delicious, and we really enjoyed the clean environment, freshness of the food. You may pay a little bit more but was worth it. Enjoy just sitting watching the world go buy or the Opera House just through the Park. There is an upstairs as well, free Wi Fi, great service and a simple but very tasteful menu.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 25, 2011",
